## Executive Summary

This ledger classifies all 22 legacy .ggen files discovered in the codebase. Each file is mapped to:
1. Its declared intent (if present)
2. Its actual content type
3. Its conformance status to current naming conventions
4. Required migration/remediation path

**Total Legacy .ggen Files:** {{ total_ggen_files }}
**Classified:** {{ classified_count }}
**Migration Required:** {{ migration_required_count }}
**Deprecated:** {{ deprecated_count }}
**Status:** {{ overall_status }}

